  "description": "RAGXOP crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C114 H80 Dy4 N8 O18 S4,7(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.590-3.852 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.00-111.20°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C114H80Dy4N8O18S4·7(C7H8).",
